<h1>Support your local dev community!</h1>

<p>devICT is 100% volunteer run and funded by the support of our community members and sponsor organizations. Our expenses include venue fees, food and drink for some in person events, and some infrastructure hosting things like our Slack bot and other services.</p>


<h2>Ways to donate</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Recurring donations</strong> can be set up through <a href="https://www.patreon.com/devict">our Patreon profile</a>.</li>
  <li><strong>One-time donations</strong> can be sent through <a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Z6AJQMBWNY7ZA">PayPal or Venmo</a>.</li>
</ul>
